    "body": "## Purpose\n\nMistral's always-on `adjust_request` path rebuilds `StreamingParserEngine` per request (including `tool_choice=\"none\"`). `_build_drop_info` recompiles regex over the full special-token vocab on the asyncio main loop, which becomes an admission bottleneck under concurrency.\n\nMemoize `_build_drop_info` with a bounded LRU keyed by `(id(config), id(tokenizer))`. Config factories are typically `@functools.cache`'d and the serving tokenizer is long-lived; shared `_DropInfo` is read-only while per-request lexer/scanner state stays on each engine instance.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] `pytest tests/parser/engine/test_drop_info_cache.py` (3 passed)\n- [x] `pytest tests/parser/engine/test_engine.py` (48 passed)\n- [x] `ruff check` / `ruff format --check` on touched files\n\nFixes #58145",
